[h2]System Adjustment[/h2]
Adding “World Save”, which allows explorers create game save for separated world. Explorers can save all world settings without specific character data, also be able to enter other world by current character

Adding controller support, explorers can modify keybinding on Setting

[h2]Gameplay Modification[/h2]
1.Survival
[list]
[*] New item Wells: Explorers can take the water from it, also can be connected with Sprinklers
[*] New item Coal: Can be found in Level 1, be used as fuel
[*] New item Spade: integrating the function of Tear Down Mode into the item, remove the button of Tear Down Mode
[*] New character attributes: Critical Damage,Decimation Rate,Evasion Rate,Life Recovery Speed
[*] New series of items Refined Crystals, the item is an important material to enhance the quality of equipment. Produce various types of refined crystals can help you enhance different attributes of equipment
[*] New series of items Pickaxe Base, this type of items can be embedded in the mining pickaxe, bringing special effects or increase the existing ones
[*] New weapon Cannon Barrel, you can put Bomb items into the Cannon Barrel, and the bombs launched from the Cannon Barrel can get stronger effects
[*] A new series of items Expanded Backpack, which can increase the number of backpack compartments;
[*] New slot for wrist equipment, can be placed bracelet equipment, the update brings you a total of 14 kinds of them;
[*] New Jewelry Set Effect, consisting of rings and bracelets, a total of 14 types of jewelry sets have been placed in this update;
[*] Equipment Program: The equipment view provides 3 equipment program tabs, which can be used for placing and switching different equipment matching;
[*] New option: Hide Helmet, after checking the box, the helmet model will no longer be displayed, but its attributes are still in effect
[*] Death Tips, when the character dies, the cause of death will be displayed;
[*] Optimized the item drop mechanism, increased the drop probability of full equipment, and reduced the repeated drop of low-value items;
[*] Optimized the content of Talent Tree to adapt to the new character attributes and values;
[/list]

2、Monster Girls gameplay adjustment:
[list]
[*] New Work gameplay for Monster Girls, Monster Girls will have different work abilities to help explorers complete complex work together
[*] New camp system, after the update, explorers can set up a camp anywhere on the map, and through the Camp Contact Desk to invite the Monster Girls to join the camp, arrange their work time and location;
[*] Optimized the home behavior of the Monster Girls, making it more natural;
[/list]
3、Technology Gameplay adjustment:
[list]
[*] Reconstructed Power Grid System, power generation/transmission equipment will automatically link and form a power grid, and machines within its coverage will automatically receive power;
[*] Reconstructed Assembly Line System, removed the original Transportation Slide, and added Roller Conveyor, Belt Splitter, Transfers and other series of items, making the assembly line gameplay more smooth and more scalable;
[*] Reconstructed the Super Drill, replacing the original component replacement with component upgrades, and added the Super Drill Upgrade Tree system, Spiral Core series of items, allowing explorers to freely decide their upgrade path;
[*] Adjusted the contents of the Technology Tree for each level;
[*] Added a new machine Hydrogenerator, which can utilize water power to generate electricity;
[/list]

[h2]Numerical Turning[/h2]
[list]
[*] Optimized the values of monsters and bosses in each level, so that the numerical expansion of each floor is relatively smooth;
[*] Optimized the values and set effects of defense sets, so that explorers have more equipment matching gameplay;
[*] Optimized the numerical effects of some dishes;
[*] Optimized the probability of getting rare fish;
[/list]

